{% set homeowner_guide %}
<p>Quick reference for Meridianville property owners:</p>

<p><strong>Tree debris is your main enemy.</strong> Meridianville's heavy tree coverage means gutters fill fast. Plan on cleaning twice a year minimum — more if you're surrounded by pines that drop needles year-round.</p>

<p><strong>Watch the slopes.</strong> After a heavy rain, walk your property. Where does water pool? Where does it flow? If it's heading toward your foundation, your gutter system isn't routing it far enough away.</p>

<p><strong>Gutter guards are worth it here.</strong> With Meridianville's tree coverage, guards aren't a luxury — they're practical time-savers. You'll still need occasional inspection, but you won't be climbing ladders monthly during fall.</p>

